category: Libs
build-depends: cygport check libxkbcommon-devel
sdesc: "Terminal-emulator State Machine (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "TSM is a state machine for DEC VT100-VT520 compatible terminal emulators. It
tries to support all common standards while keeping compatibility to existing
emulators like xterm, gnome-terminal, konsole, .."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/kmscon/libtsm
license: MIT
